The '''Great Spook Tree''' is an {{Epic}} [[Furniture]] item.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Great Spook Tree''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Vargul the Unearthed}} in {{Zone|Unincorporated}} for {{Item|Dark Candy|amount=170}} during the [[Great Spook]].

== Usage ==
When placed on the {{zone|Private Island}}, the '''Great Spook Tree''' has a {{Green|10%}} chance to generate {{Item|Green Candy}} ({{Green|85%}}) or {{Item|Purple Candy}} ({{Green|15%}}) at 12:00 AM [[SkyBlock Time]] after {{Green|30}} [[SkyBlock Day]]s (10 Hours) since candy was last generated. Candy is guaranteed to generate after {{Green|42}} [[SkyBlock Day]]s (14 Hours). Only a total of {{Green|5}} {{Item|Green Candy}} and {{Item|Purple Candy}} can be held at once.

Only one '''Great Spook Tree''' can be placed at a time. It can be picked up again by Left-Clicking it.

